<section id="why-protect">
  <div class="container2">
    <h2>🌿 Why Protecting the Environment Matters</h2>
    <p>
      The environment provides everything we need for survival, from clean air
      to food and water. However, pollution, deforestation, and climate change
      threaten our natural world.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        🌎 <strong>Prevents climate change</strong>: Reducing carbon emissions
        slows global warming.
      </li>
      <li>
        🌱 <strong>Preserves biodiversity</strong>: Protecting nature ensures
        species survival.
      </li>
      <li>
        💧 <strong>Ensures clean water</strong>: Pollution-free water is vital
        for all living beings.
      </li>
      <li>
        🏥 <strong>Improves health</strong>: A clean environment reduces
        diseases and health risks.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
